"""Version 2 options (set A lengths evened out before any run: the true match had been the longest option in 23 of 30) (addendum 2 in README.md), written after E2B / E4B / 26B-A4B hit the ceiling on version 1 and
before any model saw them. For every A and B item, two new options beside version 1's true match:
  lure: the anchor's own surface (roles, objects, setting) with an equally dramatic but different pattern
  foil: a minimal edit of the true match that breaks the pattern's key causal step
id -> (lure, foil)"""

